# Loom recurring pitfalls (do not repeat)

Before UI / terminal / session changes, skim:

1. **`docs/HARD_PROBLEMS.md`** — UI freeze checklist (no block/nested `term` lock on frame or click path).
2. **`docs/TERMINAL_IME.md`** — printable/CJK → InputHandler; Enter → KeyDown; `handle_input` FocusHandle must match the focused surface.
3. **`docs/TEXT_FIELDS.md`** — every text field: `RenameEdit` + select + copy/cut/paste (+ IME if focused).

**Quick bans:**
- Bare `String` input with only push/pop and no selection
- New focusable editor without wiring `handle_input` to the same focus (CJK silent drop)
- `with_term*` while paint already holds `term_arc`
- Sync SSH / disk / `recv` / keyring on the UI thread

File-scoped rules also apply: `text-fields.mdc`, `terminal-ime-focus.mdc`, `ui-thread-freeze.mdc`.
